### FOLLOW-NAVIGATE, {{PO.…}} values, and IS [NOT] PRESENT — flows a browser user does that scripts once needed TOOLs for
###
### This file lints cleanly with no backend. The live round-trips run in Vidyano.Script.IntegrationTests
### (FollowNavigateTests, PoInterpolationTests, PresenceTests, VerbFamilyTests.OpenPo_Refused_*).

@app = "https://demo.vidyano.com"

SIGN-IN admin / admin

### --- Follow a server Navigate ----------------------------------------------------------------
### An action whose server code calls Navigate("vesta-charge-point/vestaChargePoints/9001") sends the browser
### there. FOLLOW-NAVIGATE resolves that path through the application's routes (raw or kebab-cased route
### names, optional program-unit prefix, object ids containing '/') and opens the page.
OPEN MenuItem ChargePoints
OPEN-ROW WHERE Name = "CP-9001"
ACTION ChargePointDiagnostics
EXPECT ClientOperation Navigate CONTAINS "vesta-charge-point/"
FOLLOW-NAVIGATE AS @vcp
EXPECT PO.Type = "VestaChargePoint"

### --- Keep a value of the current record ------------------------------------------------------
### {{PO.<prop>}} / {{PO.Attr.<name>}} read the top PO frame — exactly what EXPECT PO.<prop> / EXPECT <name>
### compare. Capture into a variable to reuse after navigating away.
@vcpId = {{PO.ObjectId}}
@vendor = {{PO.Attr.Vendor}}
GO-BACK
OPEN PersistentObject "VestaChargePoint" "{{vcpId}}"
EXPECT Vendor = "{{vendor}}"

### --- Assert an attribute / column the server removed -----------------------------------------
### Only IS [NOT] PRESENT accepts a missing name; any other EXPECT on it still fails resolve-attribute.
OPEN MenuItem Locations
EXPECT Query.Columns[DefaultPublicKwhPriceEuro] IS NOT PRESENT
OPEN-ROW 0
EXPECT Attribute DefaultPublicKwhPriceEuro IS NOT PRESENT

### --- Read why an open by id was refused ------------------------------------------------------
### A refused OPEN pushes no frame; until the next verb EXPECT Notification reads the server's refusal.
OPEN PersistentObject "ChargePointConnector" "connectors/1" EXPECTING ERROR
EXPECT Notification.Type = "Error"
EXPECT Notification CONTAINS "not accepted"
